1
00:00:03,294 --> 00:00:05,294
[SHELDON SPEAKING IN MANDARIN]

2
00:00:05,797 --> 00:00:06,837
No, it's:

3
00:00:07,007 --> 00:00:12,467
[SPEAKING IN MANDARIN]

4
00:00:14,514 --> 00:00:16,264
(Howard:)What's this?

5
00:00:17,350 --> 00:00:19,100
(Sheldon:)That's what you did.

6
00:00:19,269 --> 00:00:23,569
(Sheldon:)I assumed, as in a number of languages,
that the gesture was part of the phrase.

7
00:00:23,732 --> 00:00:26,312
- Well, it's not.
- Why am I supposed to know that?

8
00:00:26,484 --> 00:00:29,984
As teacher, it's your obligation
to separate your personal idiosyncrasies...

9
00:00:30,155 --> 00:00:31,615
(Sheldon:)...from the subject matter.

10
00:00:32,157 --> 00:00:34,947
- I'm glad you decided to learn Mandarin.
- Why?

11
00:00:35,118 --> 00:00:39,038
(Howard:)Once you're fluent, you'll have a
billion more people to annoy instead of me.

12
00:00:40,665 --> 00:00:41,705
(Leonard(entering):)Hey.

13
00:00:41,875 --> 00:00:43,915
[SPEAKING IN MANDARIN]

14
00:00:44,335 --> 00:00:47,625
(Howard:)You just called Leonard
a syphilitic donkey.

15
00:00:48,590 --> 00:00:52,220
(Sheldon:)My apologies, Leonard.
I'm only as good as my teacher.

16
00:00:53,094 --> 00:00:54,424
(Leonard:)Why are you learning Chinese?

17
00:00:54,721 --> 00:00:57,851
(Sheldon:)I believe the Szechuan Palace
has been passing off orange chicken...

18
00:00:58,016 --> 00:01:01,186
(Sheldon:)...as tangerine chicken,
and I intend to confront them.

19
00:01:02,145 --> 00:01:05,895
(Leonard:)If I were you, I'd be more concerned
about what they're passing off as chicken.

20
00:01:08,985 --> 00:01:12,195
- I need to use your window.
- Oh, hey. Yeah, no, sure, go ahead.

21
00:01:13,615 --> 00:01:16,615
Hey, jerk face. You forgot your iPod.

22
00:01:18,495 --> 00:01:20,745
- What's going on?
- I'll tell you what's going on.

23
00:01:20,914 --> 00:01:24,584
That stupid, self-centered bastard
wrote about our sex life in his blog.

24
00:01:27,170 --> 00:01:30,590
(Penny:)Drop dead,
you stupid, self-centered bastard.

25
00:01:32,175 --> 00:01:33,675
(Penny:)Thank you.

26
00:01:36,763 --> 00:01:38,303
(Sheldon:)Okay, where were we?

27
00:01:38,848 --> 00:01:42,058
(Howard:)Not now. I have a blog to find.

